1
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:06,340
(Leonard:)Did you guys see the paper

2
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:08,430
in The American Physics
Journal on supersolids?

3
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:09,630
(Leonard:)It's pretty interesting.

4
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:10,870
(Leonard:)This guy's working from
a hypothesis where...

5
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:12,850
