6
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:14,640
What? Don't ruin it for me, man.

7
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:17,480
(Raj:)I printed out a PDF
to read on the potty.

8
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:18,530
(Howard:)On the potty?

9
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:19,580
(Howard:)What are you, five?

10
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,560
(Raj:)It's a potty. What do you call it?

11
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:22,580
(Howard:)Toilet.

12
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:23,570
(Raj:)That's a little vulgar for

13
00:00:23,570 --> 00:00:24,700
(Raj:)the dinner table, don't you think?

14
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,820
Oh, and "potty" is okay?

15
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:27,820
"Potty" is innocent.

16
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:28,940
"Potty" is adorable.

17
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:31,710
(Howard:)What do you do in the potty,
wee-wee?

18
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:34,040
(Raj:)If I don't have to boom-boom.

19
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:36,410
(Sheldon:)Greetings.

20
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:38,580
(Sheldon:)You all remember Amy Farrah Fowler.

21
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,800
