feminine hygiene supplies.

25
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:45,720
Aha. Okay.

26
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,890
(Sheldon:)I believe she's
experiencing her menses.

27
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,140
(Amy:)Actually, I'm not.

28
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:51,890
(Amy:)In order to avoid surprises,
I wear them all the time.

29
00:00:51,890 --> 00:00:53,090
Aha. Okay.

30
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,480
"Toilet's" sounding
pretty good now, huh?

31
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:59,900
(Penny:)Hey, look, it's Shamy.

32
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:01,240
(Amy:)Shamy?

